l fill up the number of corpses, he shall crush the heads of many on the earth."]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["He shall drink of the brook in the way; therefore shall he lift up the head."]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":207,"caller":"+","text":"Or, holiness, i. e. holy things.","reference":{"chapter":109,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/eng_bre/PSA/109.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_bre/PSA/110.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_bre/PSA/108.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}